here 1st for installing the tailwind we have to hit the "npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite" this commond in the terminal
after that we have to check in the package.json weather this file install or not after checking the installation we will see that hoow to import the tailwind css "import tailwindcss from '@tailwindcss/vite'" this is the  process to import the "tailwind css" after importing we have to use the plugin of the tailwind css 'tailwindcss(),'

after that we have to put the tailwind css file  in to the 'index.css' folder of the vite '@import "tailwindcss";'

now  the process of the tailwind css is exicuted we can run the t s in the browser that can help us to improve our styling 

