if we have to increase our productivity timing we have to add the daisy ui  in our code for better optimxation then the normal tailwind here it is why
Tailwind = raw materials (cement, bricks)
daisyUI = ready-made furniture
'note basically it will save our time for to build the far better ui from components'
👉 You can build everything from scratch (Tailwind)
👉 Or use ready components (daisyUI) to save time
👉 daisyUI = Tailwind ka shortcut + ready-made UI components